# SQLite databases and their sidecars. The named paths below are the historical
# defaults, but DATABASE_URL is configurable and the backup directory is derived
# from the database's own location, so match by shape rather than by path. A -wal
# file holds recent un-checkpointed writes, which for this application means the
# newest journal and diary entries.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
dev.db
prisma/dev.db

# Backup artifacts are full copies of the database.
*.dayflow-backup
backups/
prisma/backups/

*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
playwright-report
test-results

# Local working notes, deliberately not published.
AGENTS.md
docs/research/
